      "notes": "Moosiac can be used without an account: the notation editor, playback, import, export and printing all work offline, and scores are saved on the device. Signing in (Google or Apple) is optional and adds cloud projects, snapshots, community sharing and AI generation. AI generation uses credits; the app contains no in-app purchases and does not link to or advertise any purchase outside the app. The microphone usage description is declared because a bundled audio library contains recording code; the app never records audio. The photo library is accessed only through the system picker, to choose a profile picture."
